; Last value written to the 128K paging port $7FFD
;
; Set by #R$85CA whenever it pages a bank in; #R$85D5 saves it and restores it after calling the music player, so the
; game's own bank (bank 0, ROM 1: $10) is restored. Unused on a 48K machine apart from the one write made by #R$6000.
@label=PagingState
g$8507 DEFB $00
